# Tauri mobile.
#
# The native projects under src-tauri/gen/ ARE tracked — both carry hand edits
# (MainActivity enables edge-to-edge; project.yml sets orientations and the
# Rust build phase) that `tauri android/ios init` would not reproduce.
#
# What is not tracked is anything regenerated on build. gen/apple/.gitignore
# and gen/android/.gitignore already cover build output, .gradle, local.properties
# and key.properties; the rules below add the Xcode project itself, which
# XcodeGen rebuilds from gen/apple/project.yml and which embeds a personal
# DEVELOPMENT_TEAM id. Regenerate it with `pnpm tauri ios init`.
src-tauri/gen/apple/chartmate.xcodeproj/
src-tauri/gen/apple/build/
src-tauri/gen/apple/Externals/
src-tauri/gen/apple/Pods/
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# Claude Code: skills under .claude/skills are tracked, local machine state is not.
.claude/worktrees
.claude/settings.local.json

# Python tooling under scripts/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# This is a pnpm project. An npm lockfile here drifts out of sync silently.
package-lock.json
